                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5ed5047e-b595-33e7-bba6-7f991076941f",
                        "entry_id": "bea9af24-60b7-306b-97a1-8896a089659d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "diminutive of пахито́са (paxitósa)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "diminutive",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa0492bf-4e3c-4e0d-b6fe-cfd30564ea91",
                                "sense_id": "5ed5047e-b595-33e7-bba6-7f991076941f",
                                "text": "— Марианна! — вдруг громким голосом промолвила Сипягина, — ты не церемонься перед новым лицом… кури с богом свою пахитоску. Тем более, — прибавила она, обращаясь к Нежданову, — что, я слышала, в вашем обществе все барышни курят?",
                                "translation": "'Marianna!' Madame Sipyagin observed all at once, in a loud voice, 'you need not stand on ceremony before a stranger . . . you may smoke your cigarette, and welcome. Besides,' she added, turning towards Nezhdanov, 'I have heard that in your set all the young ladies smoke?'",
                                "english": "'Marianna!' Madame Sipyagin observed all at once, in a loud voice, 'you need not stand on ceremony before a stranger . . . you may smoke your cigarette, and welcome. Besides,' she added, turning towards Nezhdanov, 'I have heard that in your set all the young ladies smoke?'"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
